          "Taxiing an aeroplane requires a pilot licence, or instruction and a competency declaration from an instructor (91.01.3). No one may be in a part of the aircraft not designed for persons (91.01.6). Flight deck admission only with the PIC's permission (91.01.7). Portable electronic devices are restricted (91.01.9). No one may endanger an aircraft or shine lasers at it (91.01.10). Time is UTC (91.01.12). A pilot who needs corrective lenses must carry a spare set (91.01.13).",
