    intro:
      "Dangerous goods are articles or substances that can endanger health, safety, property or the environment when carried by air. Part 92 controls who may offer, carry and accept them, the training required, and where they may be loaded. The detailed rules are in the ICAO Technical Instructions, which SA-CATS 92 applies.",
