          "Forbidden: dangerous goods forbidden under any circumstances; those forbidden under normal circumstances (unless exempted); any others except in accordance with the Act, Part 92 and SA-CATS 92; and infected live animals.",
          "§ Training (92.00.8)",
          "Shippers, packers, agents, commercial operators (Parts 121, 127, 135), cargo and passenger handlers, security screeners and their staff, and flight and cabin crew must complete initial and refresher dangerous goods training, provided only by an organisation designated under Part 141. Refresher training is every 24 MONTHS. Training records must be kept and available on request.",
