          "Dangerous goods may not be stowed in a cabin occupied by passengers or on the flight deck, except as permitted by the Technical Instructions (and certain excepted radioactive packages). Packages labelled 'Cargo Aircraft Only' must be loaded on cargo aircraft so that a crew member can see, handle and, where possible, separate them in flight.",
