          "Passengers and crew may not carry dangerous goods in carry-on or checked baggage or on their person except as allowed by Part 9, Chapter 1 of the Technical Instructions (e.g. limited personal items such as medicines and toiletries).",
          "§ Related PIC duty",
          "The PIC must report any dangerous goods accident or incident under Part 92 (91.02.8(4)(h)), and accident notifications must include details of any dangerous goods on board (12.02.4).",
